OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds homeless due to flats'
OL,4,Astructural issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 250 households and several
OL,7,Fbusinesses are suddenly homeless after
OL,8,Fstructural issues were found in five
OL,9,Fblocks of flats in Canning Town, east
OL,10,FLondon.
OL,12,FTwo blocks in the Caxton Works
OL,13,Fdevelopment, were evacuated on Friday
OL,14,Fevening, a week after residents of
OL,15,Fthree other buildings there were told
OL,16,Fto leave their homes due to the same
OL,17,Fissue.
OL,19,FResidents have been told not to return
OL,20,Fhome until further notice and must now
OL,21,Fpay upfront for hotel rooms.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
