OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds homeless due to flats'
OL,4,Astructural issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FBuilding manager Prime Property
OL,7,FManagement previously said structural
OL,8,Fengineers had identified an "imminent
OL,9,Frisk to life" linked to a transfer slab
OL,10,Fbeneath the blocks. The firm has not
OL,11,Fresponded to the BBC's request for
OL,12,Fcomment.
